#. Translators: name of the add-on, used as the submenu label and the input gestures category.
#. Translators: title of the add-on panel in NVDA's settings.
#. Translators: category of the add-on commands in the Input gestures dialog.
#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "MiAjedrezAccesible"
msgstr "MiAjedrezAccesible"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that starts a new chess game.
msgid "&New game..."
msgstr "&Nueva partida..."

#. Translators: help text of the "New game" menu item.
msgid "Start a new chess game"
msgstr "Iniciar una nueva partida de ajedrez"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that opens a saved game.
msgid "&Open game..."
msgstr "A&brir partida..."

#. Translators: help text of the "Open game" menu item.
msgid "Continue a saved game or review a finished one"
msgstr "Continuar una partida guardada o repasar una terminada"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that opens the chess course.
msgid "&Learn to play..."
msgstr "&Aprender a jugar..."

#. Translators: help text of the "Learn to play" menu item.
msgid "Guided lessons for people who are learning chess"
msgstr "Lecciones guiadas para quien está aprendiendo ajedrez"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that opens the chess puzzles.
msgid "&Challenges..."
msgstr "&Retos..."

#. Translators: help text of the "Challenges" menu item.
msgid "Chess puzzles that adapt to your level"
msgstr "Problemas de ajedrez que se adaptan a tu nivel"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that shows the statistics.
msgid "My &statistics..."
msgstr "&Mis estadísticas..."

#. Translators: help text of the "My statistics" menu item.
msgid "Your games, your progress in the course and in Challenges"
msgstr "Tus partidas y tu progreso en el curso y en los Retos"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that shows all the keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "&Keyboard shortcuts..."
msgstr "Ata&jos de teclado..."

#. Translators: help text of the "Keyboard shortcuts" menu item.
msgid "The keys of the board, the lessons, Challenges and the review"
msgstr "Las teclas del tablero, las lecciones, los Retos y el repaso"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that shows a hidden game again.
msgid "&Return to the game"
msgstr "&Volver a la partida"

#. Translators: help text of the "Return to the game" menu item.
msgid "Show the board of the game in progress"
msgstr "Mostrar el tablero de la partida en curso"

#. Translators: label of the add-on submenu inside NVDA's Tools menu.
msgid "Mi&AjedrezAccesible"
msgstr "Mi&AjedrezAccesible"

#. Translators: help text of the add-on submenu.
msgid "Accessible chess games"
msgstr "Partidas de ajedrez accesibles"

#. Translators: description of the command that opens the chess course, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Opens the chess course Learn to play"
msgstr "Abre el curso de ajedrez Aprender a jugar"

#. Translators: description of the command that opens the chess puzzles, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Opens the chess Challenges"
msgstr "Abre los Retos de ajedrez"

#. Translators: description of the command that shows the statistics, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Shows your chess statistics"
msgstr "Muestra tus estadísticas de ajedrez"

#. Translators: asked when starting a game while an unfinished game was saved.
msgid "You have an unfinished game, after {moves} moves. Do you want to continue it?"
msgstr "Tienes una partida sin terminar, después de {moves} jugadas. ¿Quieres continuarla?"

#. Translators: title of the question about an unfinished game.
msgid "Unfinished game"
msgstr "Partida sin terminar"

#. Translators: button that continues the unfinished game.
msgid "&Continue the game"
msgstr "&Continuar la partida"

#. Translators: button that discards the unfinished game and starts a new one.
#. Translators: item of the game menu.
msgid "&New game"
msgstr "&Nueva partida"

msgid "A game is in progress. If you start a new one, the current game will be lost. Start a new game?"
msgstr "Hay una partida en curso. Si empiezas otra, la actual se perderá. ¿Empezar una nueva partida?"

#. Translators: title of the confirmation to start a new game.
#. Translators: title of the new game dialog.
msgid "New game"
msgstr "Nueva partida"

#. Translators: said when a saved game is continued; followed by the game state.
msgid "Game continued."
msgstr "Partida continuada."

#. Translators: title of the dialog to open a saved game.
msgid "Open game"
msgstr "Abrir partida"

#. Translators: reported when the chosen file does not contain a chess game.
msgid "This file does not contain a chess game that can be read."
msgstr "Este archivo no contiene una partida de ajedrez que se pueda leer."

#. Translators: description of the command that opens the chess board, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Opens the chess board: returns to the game in progress or starts a new one"
msgstr "Abre el tablero de ajedrez: vuelve a la partida en curso o inicia una nueva"

